[55.043, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114mbob\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;253mThe key was renaming the old share first so the new one could take\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[55.993, "o", "     \u001b[38;5;253mits place without changing a single Kubernetes object. You just had\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.893, "o", "     \u001b[38;5;253mto be careful not to format that spare disk before checking what it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[57.793, "o", "     \u001b[38;5;253mheld.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[59.793, "o", "\r\n"]
[60.343, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mLes extraits récupérés sont anglais eux aussi — sinon ils ramènent toute la réponse en français.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
